            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Rychlý telefonát pro zjištění potřeb školy</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center mt-6"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center w-44 text-center scroll-reveal min-h-[220px]">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v4a1 1 0 001 1h3m10 0h3a1 1 0 001-1V7M7 21h10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1 min-h-[2.25rem]">Návrh struktury</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Navrhneme logickou strukturu obsahu a menu</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center mt-6"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center w-44 text-center scroll-reveal min-h-[220px]">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 20l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 12l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1 min-h-[2.25rem]">Design</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Vytvoříme vizuální návrh a ukázky stránek</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center mt-6"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center w-44 text-center scroll-reveal min-h-[220px]">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7h18M3 12h18M3 17h18"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1 min-h-[2.25rem]">Naplnění</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Doplníme texty, obrázky a dokumenty</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center mt-6"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center w-44 text-center scroll-reveal min-h-[220px]">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
